  "description": "Following approval for demolition of existing church hall, erection of church hall wih associated access and landscaping -details have been submitted for Condition 2 (materials), which requires samples of all materials to be submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Auhority, and Condition 3 (details in accordance with approved plans), which requires the proposal to be carried out in accordance with the approved drawings unless otherwise agreed with the Local Planning Authority.  The materials for the roof of the front elevation are proposed to be amended from aluminium (as indicated on the approved application) to solar panels which would cover the entire roof of the front elevation.  Details of other materials submitted in relation to Condition 2 are: bricks, aluminium roof to rear, windows, steel supports, canopy soffit, downpipes, vertical claddings"
